not appear on the Department of Commerce CCL list of restricted exports.
Accordingly, we believe that our product meets the qualifications of
an ECCN (export control classification number) of EAR99 and we believe
it fits the qualifications of NRR (no restrictions required), and
is thus not subject to export restrictions of any variety.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Code from the Society of Exploration Geophysicists

The program sudgwaveform and the routines deriv_n_gauss (crate
oxwave-waveforms) and hermite_n_polynomial (crate oxwave-orthogonal-polynomials)
translate code that is Copyright (c) 2007 Society of Exploration Geophysicists.
That code is used and redistributed under SEG's terms of use, archived in
LICENSES/SEG-disclaimer.txt (https://software.seg.org/disclaimer.txt). It is
marked in the source between SEG-BEGIN and SEG-END comments.

Heigl, W. M., 2007, Computing Gaussian derivative waveforms of any order:
Geophysics, 72(4), H39-H42, doi:10.1190/1.2716624.
Code: http://software.seg.org/2007/0004
